  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Primitive Tool",
  "description": "The meme relies on the racist trope of equating Black people with malfunctioning farm equipment, implying they are inferior, unthinking, and only useful for labor or maintenance tasks. This stereotype dehumanizes Black individuals by reducing them to objects or tools that require constant 'cooling' or repair.",
